#: includes/class-plugin.php
msgid "An administrator may resolve a domain through Hosting Ukraine, test a connection or fetch today’s nginx access log. Domain lookup sends the Bearer token and type=host to adm.tools, receives the accessible host-service list, and matches the domain locally without storing that list. Test and import send the saved Bearer token and matched host ID to adm.tools and may receive IP addresses, URIs, response status and size, User-Agent, and Referer. Imported records remain local, follow the configured retention, and can be cleared by source. Disconnect deletes credentials; uninstall deletes credentials, settings, schedules, capabilities, and records. IRONCREED and other services receive no fetched logs."
msgstr ""

